Add a financial goal for a client; it starts ON_TRACK. goal_type: RETIREMENT, EDUCATION,
    PROPERTY, LEGACY, LIFESTYLE, EMERGENCY, MAJOR_PURCHASE, CUSTOM. target_date is YYYY-MM-DD;
    priority 1 is the highest.

Adding a document is not available over this connector yet. Returns the ways to add one —
    the Antevo app's Vault, or the REST upload flow. Nothing is stored and no record is created;
    the other arguments are accepted but not used.

